                "description": "A very sleek design, Omnia's 226S has a square rose with a retro-modern lever. The Transatlantic Leverset With Square Rose is made out of solid brass with non-rusting materials used throughout. The Transatlantic Lever with Square Rose is available in your choice of Satin Nickel, Polished Chrome, Satin Chrome, or Oil-Rubbed Bronze finishes. It will fit 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch or 2 inch door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
